# Buster Sword's "you may cast a spell from your hand with mana value less than or equal to that damage" may cast a split
# card with fuse fused (CR 702.102a; the ruling: cast from a hand without paying its mana cost, both halves may be cast):
# the fused split spell's mana value is both halves' together, 3 + 2 = 5 (CR 702.102c, 709.4b), which the 5 damage of
# Embereth Shieldbreaker (2/1, +3/+2) allows. Turn makes Bot2's Ornithopter a red Weird 0/1, and Burn deals 2 damage to
# Bot2: 20 - 5 - 2 = 13.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Sapphire
Mox Emerald
Embereth Shieldbreaker
Buster Sword
Turn // Burn
Plains x12

[Bot2 Deck]
